  "description": "Pawska is a Polish furry convention organized by Volskar Furevents and held at Hotel Amber in Gdańsk, a venue that hosted Gdakon from 2014 to 2017. It aims to recreate an old-fashioned style of furry convention, with close relationships among attendees, a cozy and social atmosphere and affordable prices. A single-night zeroth edition was held October 26, 2024, and the first full convention was held November 28 to 30, 2025, filling the hotel's 113 beds.",
